* Shannon entropy: <%= reorgEntropy.shannonEntropy %> bits
* Normalized entropy: <%= reorgEntropy.normalizedEntropy %> (<%= reorgEntropy.normalizedEntropy > 0.8 ? 'high disorder — very unpredictable' : reorgEntropy.normalizedEntropy > 0.5 ? 'moderate disorder' : 'low disorder — somewhat predictable' %>)
