* Effective number of states: <%= reorgEntropy.effectiveNumberOfStates %>

### Serial correlation

* Lag-1 autocorrelation: <%= reorgAutocorrelation.lag1 %><%= Math.abs(reorgAutocorrelation.lag1) > 0.3 ? ' ⚠️ significant' : '' %>
* Lag-2 autocorrelation: <%= reorgAutocorrelation.lag2 %>
* Lag-3 autocorrelation: <%= reorgAutocorrelation.lag3 %>
* Ljung-Box test: Q=<%= reorgAutocorrelation.ljungBoxStatistic %>, p=<%= reorgAutocorrelation.ljungBoxPValue %> → <%= reorgAutocorrelation.isIndependent ? 'Durations are independent ✅' : 'Serial dependence detected ⚠️' %>

### Poisson process test

* Observed rate: <%= reorgPoisson.observedRate %> events/day
* Dispersion index: <%= reorgPoisson.dispersionIndex %> (<%= reorgPoisson.dispersionIndex > 2 ? 'overdispersed — clustered events' : reorgPoisson.dispersionIndex < 0.5 ? 'underdispersed — regular spacing' : 'consistent with Poisson' %>)
* χ² statistic: <%= reorgPoisson.chiSquaredStatistic %>, p=<%= reorgPoisson.chiSquaredPValue %>
* Verdict: <%= reorgPoisson.isHomogeneous ? 'Consistent with homogeneous Poisson process ✅' : 'Not a homogeneous Poisson process ⚠️' %>

